{
  "name": "Save call result",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## After the person hangs up\n\nThe place-calls workflow already marks the number called when ElevenLabs accepts the dial. This workflow only writes result_summary.\n\n1. Activate this workflow.\n2. Copy the production URL of the webhook.\n3. In ElevenLabs, set the agent post-call webhook to that URL.\n4. The payload's conversation id must match the conversation_id stored on the Call queue row.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d2f1b8c3-7a11-4e90-9b22-3c4d5e6f7001",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "elevenlabs-call-finished",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d2f1b8c3-7a11-4e90-9b22-3c4d5e6f7002",
      "name": "Call finished",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 80],
      "webhookId": "elevenlabs-call-finished"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const root = $json.body && typeof $json.body === 'object' ? $json.body : $json;\nconst data = root.data && typeof root.data === 'object' ? root.data : root;\nconst analysis = data.analysis && typeof data.analysis === 'object' ? data.analysis : {};\nconst outcome = analysis.call_successful || data.status || '';\nconst summary = analysis.transcript_summary || '';\nconst conversationId = data.conversation_id || root.conversation_id || '';\nconst result = [outcome, summary].filter((value) => value).join(' — ');\n\nreturn [{ json: { conversation_id: conversationId, result_summary: result } }];"
      },
      "id": "d2f1b8c3-7a11-4e90-9b22-3c4d5e6f7003",
      "name": "Read the webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [280, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-conversation",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.conversation_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d2f1b8c3-7a11-4e90-9b22-3c4d5e6f7004",
      "name": "Has a conversation id?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [560, 80]
    },
    {
